Error [jet.UseAfterMove]: `run.graph` was consumed by `run.graph.move()`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/move_mark_field_argument.jet:6:15
    |
  6 |     print(run.graph.len())
    |               ^^^^^
  --> tests/ui/move_mark_field_argument.jet:5:13
    |
  5 |     consume(run.graph.move())
    |             ^^^^^^^^^ `run.graph` moved to `run.graph.move()` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `run.graph` after the move, or give `run.graph.move()` a copy with `run.graph.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
